   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by recorded vote: 200 - 227 (Roll no. 141).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "11:24:25",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection. (consideration: CR H2552)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "11:14:40",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Maffei motion to recommit with instructions pending reservation of a point of order. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with an amendment adding a new section pertaining to the prohibition on default that pays China first instead of protecting America's seniors, veterans, and those harmed by natural disasters. Subsequently, the reservation was removed.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "11:13:21",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Ways and Means Committee",
     "systemCode": "hswm00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hswm00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Maffei moved to recommit with instructions to Ways and Means. (consideration: CR H2551-2553; text: CR H2551)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "10:34:22",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 202, the House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Camp amendment.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "10:17:34",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House continued with further debate on H.R. 807.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "09:26:19",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 807.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "09:25:23",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 807 with 1 hour of general debate. Motion to recommit with or without instructions allowed. Measure will be considered read. A specified amendment is in order.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-09",
   "actionTime": "09:25:18",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 202. (consideration: CR H2539-2553; text of measure as reported in House: CR H2539)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
   "actionDate": "2013-05-08",
   "actionTime": "18:14:06",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule H. Res. 202 passed House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
